WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 0892f5dde46756d4572a09e2d3543f43

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:03.339
Karibu tena. Natumaini sasa unaelewa vizuri

00:00:03.379 --> 00:00:05.259
orodha ni nini, yaani mnyororo huu wa

00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:08.279
vipengele. Hadi sasa umekuwa ukifanya kazi na orodha

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.359
ambazo thamani yake huwekwa tu

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.099
mwanzoni na kubaki hivyo. Lakini vipi kama

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:15.359
unataka kuongeza vitu kwenye orodha

00:00:15.439 --> 00:00:19.319
kadiri muda unavyopita? Kwa hili, orodha zina metodu

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.799
inayoitwa push (sukuma). Push ina ingizo moja: kitu

00:00:23.879 --> 00:00:25.599
unachotaka kuunganisha kwenye mwisho

00:00:25.639 --> 00:00:28.199
wa orodha. Kwa hiyo katika mfano huu,

00:00:28.239 --> 00:00:31.519
tunataka kusukuma neno Isaac hadi

00:00:31.619 --> 00:00:34.299
mwisho wa orodha ambayo tayari ina DJ

00:00:34.619 --> 00:00:38.139
na Bethany. Kwa hiyo kufanya hivi, Jiki hutoa

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.239
orodha nje ya sanduku, anaunganisha Isaac

00:00:41.299 --> 00:00:42.939
kwenye mwisho wa mnyororo, kisha

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.939
anairudisha yote ndani ya sanduku.

00:00:46.059 --> 00:00:48.860
Kumbuka kwamba tofauti na awali kwa string, ambapo Jiki

00:00:48.919 --> 00:00:51.739
alikuwa akitengeneza string mpya kila mara,

00:00:51.819 --> 00:00:55.819
hapa anabadilisha orodha yenyewe. Mtindo mmoja utakaouona

00:00:55.899 --> 00:00:58.579
mara nyingi katika kupanga programu ni kuanza na

00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:01.199
orodha tupu na kuijenga kidogo kidogo. Unaweza

00:01:01.259 --> 00:01:02.779
kuwazia tuna orodha kubwa ya

00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:04.819
majina, na tunataka kuyapitia yote.

00:01:05.319 --> 00:01:08.159
Kila tunapokutana na jina la mtu ambaye ni mentor,

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.779
tunaongeza kwenye orodha yetu. Mtindo huu wa kufanya marudio

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.059
na kuongeza vitu ni kitu utakachotumia mara nyingi.

00:01:15.459 --> 00:01:16.860
Sasa una mazoezi kadhaa ambapo

00:01:16.919 --> 00:01:18.759
unaweza kujaribu hili. Yatazidi

00:01:18.819 --> 00:01:21.279
kuwa magumu kadiri unavyoyafanya.

00:01:21.799 --> 00:01:24.119
Nakushauri sana utazame video za uchambuzi wa kina

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.119
mwishoni mwa kila zoezi kabla ya kuendelea.

00:01:26.739 --> 00:01:28.799
Hizo zitahakikisha unaimarisha kweli

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.180
mitindo sahihi. Furahia, na tutaonana

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:32.120
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
